add(NCO,"M","medium","medium","Residents buy $90 billion of foreign assets while foreigners buy $140 billion of domestic assets. Which description fits?","NCO is −$50 billion, a net capital inflow",["NCO is $50 billion, a net capital outflow","NCO is $230 billion, a net capital inflow","NCO is zero because both sides trade assets"],"The difference is $90 billion − $140 billion = −$50 billion.","calculate_nco","calculation");
