add(FX,"M","medium","medium","Refer to the graph. How does the demand shift change equilibrium?","The rate rises from 1.0 to 1.2 and quantity rises from 100 to 150",["The rate falls from 1.2 to 1.0 and quantity falls from 150 to 100","The rate rises from 1.0 to 1.2 while quantity stays at 100","The rate remains 1.0 while quantity rises from 100 to 150"],"The equilibrium moves along S0 from A to B, raising both the foreign-currency price of a dollar and the quantity exchanged.","read_fx_demand_shift","graph",graph("FX-02.webp"));
