add(FX,"M","medium","medium","Refer to the graph. What happens when supply moves from S0 to S1?","Quantity rises from 100 to 150 and the rate falls from 1.0 to 0.8",["Quantity falls from 150 to 100 and the rate rises from 0.8 to 1.0","Quantity rises from 100 to 150 and the rate rises from 0.8 to 1.0","Quantity stays at 100 and the rate falls to 0.8"],"The equilibrium changes from A on S0 to B on S1 along unchanged D0.","read_fx_supply_shift","graph",graph("FX-03.webp"));
