add(FX,"H","hard","hard","Refer to the graph. What appreciation is associated with the demand increase?","An increase of 0.2 foreign-currency unit per dollar, or 20 percent",["A decrease of 0.2 foreign-currency unit per dollar, or 16.7 percent","An increase of 0.2 foreign-currency unit per dollar, or 25 percent","An increase of 0.5 foreign-currency unit per dollar, or 50 percent"],"The rate rises from 1.0 to 1.2; 0.2 divided by the initial 1.0 equals 20 percent.","calculate_fx_rate_change","calculation",graph("FX-02.webp"));
