add(FX,"H","hard","hard","Demand and supply of domestic currency both increase, with no information about relative shift sizes. What is determined?","Currency quantity rises, but the exchange-rate direction is ambiguous",["Both currency quantity and the exchange rate rise","Currency quantity falls while the exchange rate rises","The exchange rate falls while currency quantity is unchanged"],"Both shifts raise equilibrium quantity. The demand increase raises the rate while the supply increase lowers it, so their relative sizes determine the rate.","analyze_simultaneous_fx_shifts");
