add(FX,"B2","medium","boss","Foreign consumers shift spending toward domestic goods. What happens in the currency market?","Currency demand rises and the domestic currency appreciates",["Currency supply rises and the domestic currency depreciates","Currency demand falls and the domestic currency depreciates","Currency supply falls while the exchange rate is unchanged"],"The export-demand increase raises demand for domestic currency, increasing its equilibrium value with supply fixed.","map_trade_shock_to_fx_demand");
